1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,067
I said take off your clothes.

2
00:00:04,633 --> 00:00:05,700
Now.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:09,100
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,333
[STUTTERING] Ah!

5
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:12,333
Don't come near me! I'm telling
you, stay away from me!

6
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:15,433
No! No taking off
of the clothes!

7
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:17,533
I'm not that kind of girl!

8
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:19,300
What are you talking about?

9
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,667
I didn't say all your clothes.

10
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,433
Just your sweater.

11
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:23,500
[DOOR OPENS]

12
00:00:24,433 --> 00:00:25,567
- Huh?
- [DOOR CLOSES]

13
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,200
(In Korean) Hello, Mr. Jeon!

14
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,733
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

15
00:00:32,733 --> 00:00:34,100
(In Korean) Hello.

16
00:00:35,633 --> 00:00:37,433
(In Korean) Shall we begin?

17
00:00:39,267 --> 00:00:40,333
(In Korean) Yes.

18
00:00:40,333 --> 00:00:41,600
[IN UNISON] Fighting!

19
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:44,400
Miss Ria. She's our stylist.

20
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,533
She will get your measurements.

21
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:48,167
Get yourself some clothes.

22
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:51,300
Wait a sec. What's wrong
with my clothes?

23
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,633
You have to look presentable.

24
00:00:52,633 --> 00:00:55,133
Hey now, Kpaps.

25
00:00:55,133 --> 00:00:56,800
For your information,

26
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:01,200
I am 10% talent
and 90% confidence.

27
00:01:01,533 --> 00:01:03,567
No OOTD required, alright?

28
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,500
Miss Ria.

29
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,567
Yes, sir?

30
00:01:06,567 --> 00:01:07,533
Jacket.

31
00:01:07,567 --> 00:01:09,400
Jacket... jacket.

32
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:12,300
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

33
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,267
Uh...

34
00:01:14,233 --> 00:01:15,400
(In Korean) This one?

35
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,700
(In Korean) Yes.

36
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,300
You can set up in the room.

37
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,633
Okay, sir.
(In Korean) Thank you.

38
00:01:21,633 --> 00:01:23,333
- Let's go, girls.
- (In Korean) Thank you.

39
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:25,433
Hannah, fighting!

40
00:01:26,333 --> 00:01:27,800
Take off your sweater now.

41
00:01:29,333 --> 00:01:30,367
Please.

42
00:01:37,367 --> 00:01:44,300
[SENSUAL MUSIC PLAYING]

43
00:01:59,267 --> 00:02:06,200
[SENSUAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

44
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:12,200
You can't look out of place
beside me.

45
00:02:14,167 --> 00:02:16,300
This guy is so full of himself.

46
00:02:18,133 --> 00:02:19,233
(In Korean) Stupid.

47
00:02:19,233 --> 00:02:22,433
Hey, you!
Stop calling me stupid.

48
00:02:22,433 --> 00:02:24,133
Stop acting like one.

49
00:02:24,633 --> 00:02:25,633
Hmph!

50
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:27,433
Come.

51
00:02:28,167 --> 00:02:29,333
[HANNAH] Come, come!

52
00:02:30,367 --> 00:02:31,400
Here.

53
00:02:32,267 --> 00:02:33,867
[HANNAH] Okay. Smile!

54
00:02:33,867 --> 00:02:36,167
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

55
00:02:36,167 --> 00:02:37,400
[DANIEL] What are you doing?

56
00:02:37,767 --> 00:02:39,767
I'm just checking
if it suits me.

57
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:45,200
See? It's not out of place.
No, no, no.
